  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "I need your energy. Nothing more, nothing less.\n\nBambi – soon-to-be graduate, top of his class, incubus. Currently there are only two things standing in the way of achieving Bambi’s latest milestone: a college boy named Yoonhu and his delicious energy. On the tails of Yoonhu’s latest breakup, Bambi begins to visit him every night in the form of special dreams. But the attraction is unexpectedly irresistible, and things get convoluted when dreams become better than reality. Everything has always been clear cut and by-the-books for this clever incubus, but will everything go according to plan this time around?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
